{"reference":"Psalms 149","book":"Psalms","chapter":149,"status":"pending","sections":[{"kind":"surrounding_passages","title":"The Psalter’s Closing Praise","blocks":[{"id":"block_1","text":"Psalm 149 appears within Psalms 146–150, the Psalter’s final crescendo of praise. The Masoretic Psalter is arranged in five books, with doxological boundaries after Psalms 41, 72, 89, and 106.","verse_refs":["Psalms 146:1-10","Psalms 147:1-20","Psalms 148:1-14","Psalms 150:1-6"],"provenance_refs":["reader_path_psalms_149_1883eff435cd874e8f6d8d7a"],"confidence":"high","interpretation_level":"disputed"}]}],"generated_metadata":null}